!node* Scratch register

Depending on your compiler, when you execute a program, some registers
can be scratched. As LDG-libraries and clients can be written with
different compilers, some problems can appear after a LDG call.
The LDG developper library save now the ''scratch register'' before
the call and restore its after the execution.


!end_document 

